# spec_id: eravos.wub-osc · version 1.0.0 · status built · template eravos.tool/1 (sound flavour)
identity:
  id: eravos.wub-osc ; label: Wub Osc ; domain: music ; category: wubs (shown as Wubs)
  purpose: the raw tone of a wobble bass — one mono voice, nothing else. Filtering, wobbling and sub are other tools.
ports:
  in:  note_in (note:trigger: note, velocity, time, duration, slide) · midi_in (armed MIDI) ·
       mod.pitch (±1 → ±1200 c) · mod.fm (±1 → ±6 FM index) · mod.spread (±1 → ±40 c, scaled by each voice's place)
  out: out (audio, stereo) — default route master; wire it into Wub Filter
params: wave [saw, square, reese, fm, hollow] · octave −3..1 · fine ±100 c · ratio [0.5, 1, 1.5, 2, 3, 4] ·
  index 0..12 · voices 1..7 · spread 0..60 c · width 0..1 · drift 0..1 · glide · attack · release · dive ±24 st ·
  diveTime · level
behaviour:
  - pitch is one ConstantSource (Hz) that every oscillator's frequency follows — glide and dive move the whole stack
  - mono, last-note legato: an overlapping note glides (Glide), a slide glides without re-attacking
  - dive: a new (non-legato) note starts Dive semitones away and lands on pitch over Dive time
  - unison: voices sit evenly from −1 to +1; each detunes by place × Spread (reese × 1.8) and pans by place × Width;
    Drift moves the spread slowly (0.23 Hz) — the reese breathing; level 1/√voices per voice
  - fm: per voice a sine modulator at Ratio × Hz drives the carrier's frequency by Index × Hz (+ mod.fm × Hz)
  - hollow: square + saw one octave up
  - changing wave or voices rebuilds the stack and unhooks every shared connection of the old one
packs: ships [factory] — 11 presets: Init Saw · Classic Wub Saw · Square Talker · Reese Roller · FM Growl 1:1 ·
  FM Riddim 2:1 · FM Clang 3:1 · FM Low Grind 0.5:1 · Hollow Yoi · Dive Bomb · Slide Lead (+1 oct)
acceptance (wub-osc.test.js): the tool contract · a note sounds at its pitch (A1 → 55 Hz at octave 0) · octave −1
  halves it · a slide glides without a gap · voices 5 is wider (L ≠ R) than voices 1 · fm with index 0 is a sine,
  index 6 is brighter · Stop all silences it

